    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Lead Intake & Qualification\nWebhook → Config → Validate → rate-limit / duplicate guard → **202 Accepted** (async) → AI scoring (message only) → deterministic bonuses → save → route HOT / WARM / COLD.\n\n- **HOT:** HubSpot contact → Slack alert → personalized email → Google Sheet\n- **WARM:** personalized follow-up → Google Sheet\n- **COLD:** static acknowledgement → Google Sheet\n\nAll thresholds, bonuses and limits are in **Config**. Failures are reported by the Error Trigger.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "d2730be0-7677-4a71-aac9-9cfe8ee5fc21",
      "name": "Note - Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
